<!-- FINALE -->
<section class="chapter finale" id="fin" data-scene="text" data-chapter="Fin" data-part="8">
  <div class="fin-sticky">
    <h2 class="fin-title">Thank you.<br /><em>Questions?</em></h2>
    <div class="fin-row">
      <p class="body-copy">Distributed databases taught us to split data, copy it and coordinate every change. NoSQL asked which of those guarantees we could relax. Pick the model that matches the shape of your data and the questions you will ask of it.</p>
